        "text": "",
        "children": [
        {
          "id": "cf8b9eff",
          "name": "NewId",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "NewId\nGenerates a new random ID for bookmarks using an alphabet char array.\n\nstatic const char alphabet[] = \"abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789\";\n\nMersenne Twister logic:\n\nstd::random_device rd;\nstd::mt19937 gen(rd());\nstd::uniform_int_distribution<int> dist(0, static_cast<int>(sizeof(alphabet)) - 2);\nstd::string id;\nid.reserve(8);\nfor (int i = 0; i < 8; ++i) id += alphabet[dist(gen)];",
          "children": [
          ]
        }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "5b374004",
        "name": "bookmark.hpp",
        "expanded": false,
        "text": "",
        "children": [
        {
          "id": "0cc94aaf",
          "name": "Bookmark Struct",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Bookmark Struct\n\nstruct Bookmark\n{\n    std::string id;\n    int line = -1;\n};",
          "children": [
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "af6e25d5",
          "name": "Variables",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Variables\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nstd::string NewId();",
          "children": [
          ]
        }
        ]
      }
      ]
