            {
              "id": "9e869c63",
              "name": "Close",
              "expanded": false,
              "text": "Close\nCloses the bookmarks dialog by updating the related variables.",
              "children": [
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "1c3bfc71",
              "name": "Jump",
              "expanded": false,
              "text": "Jump\n\nNavigates to the selected bookmark's node.\nIf it is a line specific bookmark, it navigates to that particular line.",
              "children": [
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "871140ee",
              "name": "Move Selection",
              "expanded": false,
              "text": "Move Selection\n\nSignature: void MoveSelection(int dir)\nMethod: MoveSelection\nReturns: void\nParameters:\n    dir int\n\n\nMoves the selection up or down among the bookmarks list.",
              "children": [
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "979ca95a",
              "name": "Move to Start / End",
              "expanded": false,
              "text": "Move to Start / End\nMoveToStart()\nMoveToEnd()",
              "children": [
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "12656e17",
              "name": "Recompute Bookmarks",
              "expanded": false,
              "text": "Recompute Bookmarks\n\nSignature: void Recompute()\nMethod: Recompute\nReturns: void\n\nRebuilds the entries_ from the state_->bookmarks.\nGathers all the nodes for looking them up by id.\nSets the selection_.\nIt also displays the line number if the bookmark is to a specific line of text.",
              "children": [
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "ddc57cb4",
              "name": "Unbookmark",
              "expanded": false,
              "text": "Unbookmark\nRemoves the selected bookmark.\nThe entries_ mirrors state_->bookmarks.\nThis also handles scroll to top.",
              "children": [
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "40459064",
              "name": "Variables",
              "expanded": false,
              "text": "Variables\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nstd::shared_ptr<EditorState> state_;\nbool* show_;\nstd::vector<Entry> entries_;\nstd::vector<std::string> rendered_;\nint selection_ = 0;\nint scroll_ = 0;\nint content_width_ = 20;\nstatic constexpr int kVisibleRows = 18;",
              "children": [
              ]
            }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "200c852e",
            "name": "Public Members",
            "expanded": false,
            "text": "Public Members",
            "children": [
            {
              "id": "276e0339",
              "name": "Constructor",
              "expanded": false,
              "text": "Constructor\n\nSignature: BookmarksDialog(std::shared_ptr<EditorState> state, bool* show) : state_(std::move(state)), show_(show)\nConstructor: BookmarksDialog\nParameters:\n    state std::shared_ptr<EditorState>\n    show  bool*\nInitializers:\n    state_ std::move(state)\n    show_  show",
              "children": [
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "ae61229c",
              "name": "Event Call",
              "expanded": false,
              "text": "Event Call\n\nSignature: bool OnEvent(ftxui::Event event) override\nMethod: OnEvent\nReturns: bool\nQualifiers: override\nParameters:\n    event ftxui::Event\n\n\nThis is the ftxui Event override.\nIt handles navigation as well as Escape, Return, and deletes.\n\n\nExamples\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nif (event == ftxui::Event::Escape)\n{\n    Close();\n    return true;\n}\n\nif (event.is_character() && event.character() == \"g\")\n{\n    if (pending_g_)\n    {\n        pending_g_ = false;\n        MoveToStart();\n        return true;\n    }\n    pending_g_ = true;\n    return true;\n}",
              "children": [
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "9f7998e5",
              "name": "Render",
              "expanded": false,
              "text": "Render\n\nSignature: ftxui::Element Render() override\nMethod: Render\nReturns: ftxui::Element\nQualifiers: override\n\nRenders the bookmarks dialog.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n* First do a _Recompute Bookmarks_.\n\n* Gather the Bookmarks.\n\n* PadRight.\n\n* Build the footer.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nCreate the dialog's window:\n\nreturn ftxui::window(ftxui::text(\" ` Bookmarks \"),\n                    ftxui::vbox({\n                        ftxui::separator(),\n                        ftxui::vbox(std::move(rows)),\n                        ftxui::separator(),\n                        ftxui::text(PadRight(footer, row_width)) | ftxui::dim,\n                    })) |\n       ftxui::size(ftxui::WIDTH, ftxui::LESS_THAN, 92) |\n       ftxui::size(ftxui::HEIGHT, ftxui::LESS_THAN, 24);",
              "children": [
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "46f73897",
              "name": "Variables",
              "expanded": false,
              "text": "Variables\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nbool Focusable() const override { return true; }\n\nbool pending_g_ = false;",
              "children": [
              ]
            }
            ]
          }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "731cf756",
          "name": "Entry Struct",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Entry Struct\nUsed to create the treeview nodes.\nThe line value denotes whether it is a line specific bookmark.\nIf the value is -1 it is NOT.\n\nstruct Entry\n{\n    treeview::TreeNode* node = nullptr;\n    int depth = 0;\n    int line = -1;\n};",
          "children": [
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "6e263fb9",
          "name": "Right Padding",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Right Padding\n\nSignature: std::string PadRight(const std::string& s, std::size_t width)\nMethod: PadRight\nReturns: std::string\nParameters:\n    s     const std::string&\n    width std::size_t\n\nThis indents the bookmarks to match their depth in the treeview.\n#todo : We should be able to make this a globally accessible method.",
          "children": [
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "d97cdff3",
          "name": "Create the Dialog",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Create the Dialog\n\nSignature: ftxui::Component MakeBookmarksDialog(std::shared_ptr<EditorState> state, bool* show)\nMethod: MakeBookmarksDialog\nReturns: ftxui::Component\nParameters:\nstate std::shared_ptr<EditorState>\nshow  bool*\n\n\nFtxui Make of type BookmarksDialog.",
          "children": [
          ]
        }
        ]
      },
