            {
              "id": "435017c9",
              "name": "Pick a File",
              "expanded": false,
              "text": "Pick a File\n\nSignature: void Activate()\nMethod: Activate\nReturns: void",
              "children": [
              {
                "id": "5751ff6e",
                "name": "Apply the Filter",
                "expanded": false,
                "text": "Apply the Filter\n\nSignature: void ApplyFilter()\nMethod: ApplyFilter\nReturns: void\n\n* Applies the currently set filter.",
                "children": [
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "ec8baedf",
                "name": "Clear the Filter",
                "expanded": false,
                "text": "Clear the Filter\n\nSignature: void ClearFilter()\nMethod: ClearFilter\nReturns: void\n\nSimply clear out the filter variables.",
                "children": [
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "a5e8af9d",
                "name": "Compute the Top",
                "expanded": false,
                "text": "Compute the Top\n\nSignature: int ComputeTop(int sel, int total) const\nMethod: ComputeTop\nReturns: int\nQualifiers: const\nParameters:\n    sel   int\n    total int\n\nComputation logic:\n\nconst int max_top = std::max(0, total - kVisibleRows);\nint top = std::min(scroll_, max_top);\nif (sel < top) top = sel;\nif (sel >= top + kVisibleRows) top = sel - kVisibleRows + 1;\nreturn std::max(0, std::min(top, max_top));",
                "children": [
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "c533cd86",
                "name": "Enter At",
                "expanded": false,
                "text": "Enter At\n\nSignature: void EnterAt(bool pick_file)\nMethod: EnterAt\nReturns: void\nParameters:\n    pick_file bool\n\n`l` always navigates into the folder. For save/export-style\nops (`browser_command` set) the dialog is a folder picker:\nEnter hands the chosen folder back to the command line so a\nfilename can be typed. `:` picks the currently shown folder\nthe same way.",
                "children": [
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "e8d6da58",
                "name": "Handle Filter Event",
                "expanded": false,
                "text": "Handle Filter Event\n\nSignature: bool OnFilterEvent(ftxui::Event event)\nMethod: OnFilterEvent\nReturns: bool\nParameters:\n    event ftxui::Event",
                "children": [
                {
                  "id": "44655cb1",
                  "name": "Escape Key",
                  "expanded": false,
                  "text": "Escape Key\n\nClearFilter();\nreturn true;",
                  "children": [
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "25b90d2c",
                  "name": "Return Key",
                  "expanded": false,
                  "text": "Return Key\n\nfilter_active_ = false;\nselection_ = 0;\nreturn true;",
                  "children": [
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "e8d1ddd7",
                  "name": "Backspace Key",
                  "expanded": false,
                  "text": "Backspace Key\n\nif (!filter_.empty()) filter_.pop_back();\nselection_ = 0;\nreturn true;",
                  "children": [
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "01e7ca0a",
                  "name": "General Key Processing",
                  "expanded": false,
                  "text": "General Key Processing\n\nfilter_ += event.character();\nselection_ = 0;\nreturn true;",
                  "children": [
                  ]
                }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "1c07ed35",
                "name": "Recompute",
                "expanded": false,
                "text": "Recompute\n\nSignature: void Recompute()\nMethod: Recompute\nReturns: void\n\n* Refresh this dialog via the state_\n\nSignature: void Relist()\nMethod: Relist\nReturns: void\n\n            * List the currently selected directory's contents.",
                "children": [
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "34c0d9a1",
                "name": "Variables",
                "expanded": false,
                "text": "Variables\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nstd::shared_ptr<EditorState> state_;\nbool* show_;\nftxui::Box box_;\nstd::string dir_;\nstd::string start_dir_;\nbool needs_refresh_ = true;\nstd::vector<Entry> entries_;\nstd::vector<std::size_t> visible_;\nstd::string filter_;\nstd::string last_filter_;\nbool filter_active_ = false;\nint selection_ = 0;\nint scroll_ = 0;\nint content_width_ = 24;\nbool pending_g_ = false;",
                "children": [
                ]
              }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "7f275e89",
              "name": "Set the Directory",
              "expanded": false,
              "text": "Set the Directory\n\nSignature: void SetDir(const std::string& path)\nMethod: SetDir\nReturns: void\nParameters:\n    path const std::string&",
              "children": [
              ]
            }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "2704b157",
            "name": "Public Members",
            "expanded": false,
            "text": "Public Members",
            "children": [
            {
              "id": "c8ec3c4a",
              "name": "Constructor",
              "expanded": false,
              "text": "Constructor\n\nSignature: FileBrowserDialog(std::shared_ptr<EditorState> state, bool* show) : state_(std::move(state)), show_(show)\nConstructor: FileBrowserDialog\nParameters:\n    state std::shared_ptr<EditorState>\n    show  bool*\nInitializers:\n    state_ std::move(state)\n    show_  show",
              "children": [
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "bf824ad1",
              "name": "Ftxui Event",
              "expanded": false,
              "text": "Ftxui Event\n\nSignature: bool OnEvent(ftxui::Event event) override\nMethod: OnEvent\nReturns: bool\nQualifiers: override\nParameters:\n    event ftxui::Event",
              "children": [
              {
                "id": "b7edcdf5",
                "name": "Key Events",
                "expanded": false,
                "text": "Key Events",
                "children": [
                {
                  "id": "3d07040f",
                  "name": "Escape",
                  "expanded": false,
                  "text": "Escape\n\nif (!filter_.empty())\n{\n    ClearFilter();\n    return true;\n}\nClose();\nreturn true;",
                  "children": [
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "2380739b",
                  "name": "/",
                  "expanded": false,
                  "text": "/\n\nfilter_active_ = true;\nreturn true;",
                  "children": [
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "f2256427",
                  "name": ":",
                  "expanded": false,
                  "text": ":\n\nThe dialog just picks a directory; `:` hands the currently\nshown directory back to the save/export command line so the\nuser can type a filename.\n\nconst std::string command = std::move(state_->browser_command);\nstate_->browser_command.clear();\nconst std::string target = (fs::path(dir_) / \"\").string();\nClose();\nscribbolyth::op::OpenCommandLineWithArgs(state_, command, target);\nreturn true;",
                  "children": [
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "aa09f907",
                  "name": "Return",
                  "expanded": false,
                  "text": "Return\n\nSelect the file.\n\nActivate();\nreturn true;",
                  "children": [
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "a81fbfe7",
                  "name": "l",
                  "expanded": false,
                  "text": "l\n\nEnter the selected directory.\n\nEnterAt(/*pick_file=*/false);\nreturn true;",
                  "children": [
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "99679b1c",
                  "name": "j / Arrow Down",
                  "expanded": false,
                  "text": "j / Arrow Down\n\nMove the selection down.\n\nMoveSelection(+1);\npending_g_ = false;\nreturn true;",
                  "children": [
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "8ff6e388",
                  "name": "k / Arrow Up",
                  "expanded": false,
                  "text": "k / Arrow Up\n\nMove the selection up.\n\nMoveSelection(-1);\npending_g_ = false;\nreturn true;",
                  "children": [
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "67d292f6",
                  "name": "h",
                  "expanded": false,
                  "text": "h\n\nMove up one directory.\n\nGoUp();\npending_g_ = false;\nreturn true;",
                  "children": [
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "eeb48cff",
                  "name": "g",
                  "expanded": false,
                  "text": "g\n\nIf the first 'g', await for a second 'g'.\nIf the second 'g', move to the top.\n\nif (pending_g_) JumpToTop();\nelse pending_g_ = true;\nreturn true;",
                  "children": [
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "0191a615",
                  "name": "G",
                  "expanded": false,
                  "text": "G\n\nMove to the bottom.\n\nJumpToBottom();\nreturn true;",
                  "children": [
                  ]
                }
                ]
              }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "f4e3e181",
              "name": "Render the Element",
              "expanded": false,
              "text": "Render the Element\n\nSignature: ftxui::Element Render() override\nMethod: Render\nReturns: ftxui::Element\nQualifiers: override",
              "children": [
              {
                "id": "d116215c",
                "name": "Recompute",
                "expanded": false,
                "text": "Recompute\n\nBefore rendering ensure that everything is in sync with the state_.\n\nRecompute();",
                "children": [
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "840ceee8",
                "name": "Const Variables",
                "expanded": false,
                "text": "Const Variables\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nconst int total = static_cast<int>(visible_.size());\nconst int sel = std::min(selection_, std::max(0, total - 1));\nconst int top = ComputeTop(sel, total);\nconst int count = std::min(kVisibleRows, std::max(0, total - top));\nconst int dlg_width { 90 };\n\nconst std::size_t row_width = static_cast<std::size_t>(content_width_ + 2);",
                "children": [
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "b67dc721",
                "name": "Fetch the items.",
                "expanded": false,
                "text": "Fetch the items.\n\nIf there are none, output (empty directory).\nThis is driven by the total const value.",
                "children": [
                ]
              }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "325b5754",
              "name": "Variables",
              "expanded": false,
              "text": "Variables\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nbool Focusable() const override { return true; }",
              "children": [
              ]
            }
            ]
          },
