          "text": "Tailing\n\nSignature: std::string Tail(const std::string& s, std::size_t width)\nMethod: Tail\nReturns: std::string\nParameters:\n    s     const std::string&\n    width std::size_t\n\n#todo : We should be able to make this a globally accessible method.",
