        {
          "id": "74225a0b",
          "name": "To Lower Case",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "To Lower Case\n\nSignature: std::string Lower(const std::string& s)\nMethod: Lower\nReturns: std::string\nParameters:\n    s const std::string&\n\n#todo : We should be able to make this a globally accessible method.",
          "children": [
