        {
          "id": "2148b72b",
          "name": "Is Blank",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Is Blank\n\nSignature: bool IsBlank(const std::string& s)\nMethod: IsBlank\nReturns: bool\nParameters:\n    s const std::string&\n\nThis is a helper method for when the editor is seeking for the end of words etc.",
          "children": [
          ]
