              "expanded": false,
              "text": "Constructor\n\nSignature: HelpDialog(std::shared_ptr<EditorState> state, const std::string& path, bool* show) : state_(std::move(state)), show_(show)\nConstructor: HelpDialog\nParameters:\n    state std::shared_ptr<EditorState>\n    path  const std::string&\n    show  bool*\nInitializers:\n    state_ std::move(state)\n    show_  show",
              "children": [
