          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Pad Right\n\nSignature: std::string PadRight(const std::string& s, std::size_t width)\nMethod: PadRight\nReturns: std::string\nParameters:\n    s     const std::string&\n    width std::size_t",
          "children": [
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2556314b",
          "name": "Parse Entries",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Parse Entries\n\nSignature: void ParseEntries(const std::string& path, std::vector<HelpEntry>& out)\nMethod: ParseEntries\nReturns: void\nParameters:\n    path const std::string&\n    out  std::vector<HelpEntry>&",
