        },
        {
          "id": "685aaf0a",
          "name": "Make Help Dialog",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Make Help Dialog\n\nSignature: ftxui::Component MakeHelpDialog(std::shared_ptr<EditorState> state, const std::string& config_path, bool* show)\nMethod: MakeHelpDialog\nReturns: ftxui::Component\nParameters:\nstate       std::shared_ptr<EditorState>\nconfig_path const std::string&\nshow        bool*",
