      {
        "id": "ae71f8c2",
        "name": "help.hpp",
        "expanded": false,
        "text": "",
        "children": [
        {
          "id": "9d8d1b00",
          "name": "Help Entry Struct",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Help Entry Struct\n\nstruct HelpEntry\n{\n    std::string mode;\n    std::string key;\n    std::string command;\n    std::string op;\n    std::string description;\n    std::string line;   // the diagram line shown in the dialog\n};",
          "children": [
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "96f831e8",
          "name": "Make the Dialog",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Make the Dialog\n\nBuild the key-binding help dialog. Reads its entries from `config_path`\n(the same commands.conf format the loader uses). The dialog is shown\nwhile *show is true; Escape hides it. While shown, it consumes every\nevent so no app key bindings fire.\n\nftxui::Component MakeHelpDialog(std::shared_ptr<EditorState> state, const std::string& config_path, bool* show);",
          "children": [
          ]
        }
        ]
      }
      ]
    },
