      {
        "id": "13b2f738",
        "name": "convert.hpp",
        "expanded": false,
        "text": "",
        "children": [
        {
          "id": "1ce3732b",
          "name": "Html Theme Struct",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Html Theme Struct\n\nstruct HtmlTheme\n{\n    bool present = false;\n    std::string current_theme;\n    std::string themes;\n    std::string style_content;\n};\n\nThe theme material of an imported HTML file, captured verbatim from the\nweb app's own script declarations so a later export can reproduce it.\n`current_theme` and `themes` hold the full `let currentTheme = ...;` /\n`let themes = [...];` statements; `style_content` is the inner text of\nthe `<style id=\"theme_styles\">` block. Empty strings mean the piece was\nabsent from the source; `present` is true when any piece was found.",
          "children": [
          ]
        }
        ]
      }
      ]
    },
