        "id": "0c17cf71",
        "name": "regex.hpp",
        "expanded": false,
        "text": "",
        "children": [
        {
          "id": "568cdaf0",
          "name": "Make Regex Dialog",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Make Regex Dialog\n\n!_method\n\nRegex cheat sheet dialog. Reads its entries from `config_path` (the\nsame whitespace-separated format used by commands.conf: CATEGORY,\nPATTERN, EXAMPLE, then an optionally quoted DESCRIPTION). The dialog is\nshown while *show is true; Escape hides it. While shown it consumes\nevery event so no app key bindings fire.",
          "children": [
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "a8572100",
          "name": "Regex Entry Struct",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Regex Entry Struct\n\nstruct RegexEntry\n{\n    std::string category;\n    std::string pattern;\n    std::string example;\n    std::string description;\n    std::string line;   // the padded diagram line shown in the dialog\n};",
          "children": [
          ]
        }
        ]
      }
      ]
    },
