            {
              "id": "53b8c430",
              "name": "Recompute Tags",
              "expanded": false,
              "text": "Recompute Tags\n\nSignature: void RecomputeTags(const std::vector<std::pair<treeview::TreeNode*, int>>& all)\nMethod: RecomputeTags\nReturns: void\nParameters:\n    all const std::vector<std::pair<treeview::TreeNode*, int>>&\n\nTag search: a leading '#' lists matching tags; picking one (or an\nexact match) lists the nodes whose content carries that tag.",
              "children": [
