          "text": "Ftxui Make Dialog\n\nSignature: ftxui::Component MakeSearchDialog(std::shared_ptr<EditorState> state, bool* show, DialogMode mode)\nMethod: MakeSearchDialog\nReturns: ftxui::Component\nParameters:\nstate std::shared_ptr<EditorState>\nshow  bool*\nmode  DialogMode",
