      {
        "id": "dc678ed6",
        "name": "visual_block.hpp",
        "expanded": false,
        "text": "",
        "children": [
        {
          "id": "987644b3",
          "name": "Introduction",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Introduction\n\nVisual Block mode (Vim Ctrl+V): a rectangular, column-wise selection.\nThe anchor and cursor positions define the block's row span and column\nspan; every line between row_lo and row_hi has its columns between\ncol_lo and col_hi (inclusive) selected. Lines shorter than the block\nsimply expose no columns past their end.",
          "children": [
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "d7f588c1",
          "name": "Block Struct",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Block Struct \n\nstruct Block\n{\n    int row_lo = 0;\n    int row_hi = 0;\n    int col_lo = 0;\n    int col_hi = 0;\n};",
          "children": [
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ed1242b7",
          "name": "Make Block",
          "expanded": false,
          "text": "Make Block \n\nSignature: inline Block MakeBlock(int aRow, int aCol, int bRow, int bCol)\nMethod: MakeBlock\nReturns: inline Block\nParameters:\n    aRow int\n    aCol int\n    bRow int\n    bCol int",
          "children": [
          ]
        }
        ]
      }
      ]
